Webfwlog-0.91 has been released. This version fixes a SQL injection 
vulnerability and also has many other new features and bug fixes.  
Webfwlog supports standard netfilter system logs as well as database 
logs using ulogd.  For more information and a demo please visit:

http://www.webfwlog.net
 
Enjoy!

